    "reviewedStatements": [
      "25% of major and 25% of degree must be taken through Liberty University.",
      "Residential undergraduate policy recognizes ACE online-course providers and applies transfer standards to experiential learning. No separate combined alternative-credit ceiling was published in the reviewed section.",
      "The residential Psychology degree permits 3 credits from PSYC 495, PSYC 497 or PSYC 499.",
      "PSYC 497 is 3 credits; prerequisite (PSYC 200 or PSYC 101 or PSYC 210 or GEED 201) and PSYC 255; Offered Residential and Online. Its current published description addresses moral and ethical concepts and principles in psychology."
    ],
